    This guide supports shoppers on the <strong><a href="/">Kakobuy Spreadsheet</a></strong> directory at kakobuy-cn.com. Spreadsheet rows rarely mention <strong>customs</strong>—yet every outbound carton eventually meets a broker algorithm or an officer checklist.
